      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:2:23:5",
      "text": [
        " الْإِخْوَةِ مِنَ الْأُمِّ مَعَ الْجَدِّ قَالَ لِلْإِخْوَةِ مِنَ الْأُمِّ مَعَ الْجَدِّ نَصِيبُهُمُ الثُّلُثُ مَعَ الْجَدِّ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Mahboub, from Ali Bin Raib, from Ibn Muskan, from Al Halby, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> regarding the brothers from the mother, with the grandfather. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘For the brothers from the mother with the grandfather, their share is the third with the grandfather’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "5. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn Mahbub from Ali ibn Ri’ab from ibn Muskan from al- Halabiy who has narrated the following: “About the case of brothers from one’s mother with a grandfather, abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘The share of brothers from one’s mother is one-third if a grandfather is with them.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
